          "\"Pur sono stanco\" puts a finite verb after \"pur\". \"Pur\" needs the gerund: \"pur essendo stanco\". \"Malgrado di\" and \"nonostante di\" add a preposition that isn't there: \"malgrado il freddo\", \"nonostante il traffico\".",
